Package: com.duoface.carplay.nativescenehost
Name: DuoFace Native Dashboard Scene Host (Development)
Version: 0.0.8~touchowner1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Section: Development
Maintainer: DuoFace Independent
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), mobilesubstrate
Description: Rootless CarPlay CPWindow visual scene plus narrow, 30-second SpringBoard external-input-owner diagnostic. SpringBoard registers a passive Darwin event listener and only creates a bounded 110x40 probe when DuoFace CarPlay app connects; removes it on disconnect/timeout. Does not host apps, override Dock, respring automatically, copy vendor code or claim touch verified.
